pported by an influx of new settlers. Religiously this manifest in a enriched diversification of ritual material culture, including cave shrines and burial sites, communal feasting at population power centres, and perhaps also the beginning of a ritual landscape.”'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 851, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 769})
